{"version":1,"key":"card:550","content":{"id":550,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为什么复习（回顾）很重要："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对抗遗忘，人总是高估自己的记忆力，根据艾宾浩斯遗忘曲线，一天后 74% 被遗忘掉，一个月后，79% 被遗忘掉，但是如果及时复习的话，长期记忆就能保持"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"内化知识、整理知识结构的一个新机会"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"整理笔记结构，去除不需要、冗余的部分，精炼笔记表达"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"触发思考，发现新观点，新联系"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"刺激行动，时常查看行动原则、人生目标，纠正自身的行为"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"回顾过往的美好瞬间，回顾自身成长经历，提升幸福感，提升自信心"}]}]}]}],"tags":["学习方法","读书/笔记的方法"],"createTime":1743742694649,"updateTime":1743742805699,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743742805699}}